'''Space Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtained upon clearing [[Attack on R-Cyclone (Expert)|Attack On R-Cyclone]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] greatly increases health and improves chances for [[Critical|Critical Hits]] and [[Barrier Breaker|Barrier Breaking]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], it can be obtained from the [[Rare Cat Capsule]] pool once clearing [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Stage 48]] from Chapter 1.

